Third-party notice / 第三方说明

Guided Rounds is a modified derivative of the community addon
"DIY your weapon to shoot like Donk (APW-1 Anti-Materiel lock-on, DIY-able)"
(https://ayakamods.com/mods/diy-your-weapon-to-shoot-like-donk-apw-1-%E5%8F%8D%E5%99%A8%E6%9D%90%E9%94%81%E5%A4%B4mod-diy-able.4226/).
